i Pittura" in agosto, }{\fs20\super\cf1\cgrid "}{\fs20\cf1\cgrid Arte in Bancarella}{\fs20\super\cf1\cgrid "}{\fs20\cf1\cgrid  a }{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2\cf1\cgrid Diano in settembre) non tradiscono ancora il mutamento}{\fs20\cf1\cgrid  in corso, ma alla 
prima }{\fs20\super\cf1\cgrid "}{\fs20\cf1\cgrid Mostra Nazionale d}{\fs20\super\cf1\cgrid '}{\fs20\cf1\cgrid Arti }{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2\cf1\cgrid Figurativ}{\fs20\cf1\cgrid e}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2\super\cf1\cgrid "}{\fs20\expnd0\expndtw-2\cf1\cgrid 
